AB  - Nowadays, more and more person pays the attention to their own healthcare status, and the physiological parameters are further benefit to the medical diagnosis and drug treatment. Thus, the wearable sensors with high performance and comfortability would be desirable candidate for the unique application. Various sensors including pressure sensor, strain sensor, and chemical sensor have been widely developed. With emerge of two-dimensional materials, the graphene material with superior electric and mechanical properties could be active element for the wearable sensors. Therefore, the chemical sensor of alcohol sensor and mechanical sensor of pressure sensor were investigated in this work, which shows promising potential in the healthcare.
