TI  - Is Smoking Cessation in Young Adults Associated With Tobacco Retailer Availability in Their Activity Space?
T2  - NICOTINE & TOBACCO RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - SOCIAL INEQUALITIES
KW  - OUTLET DENSITY
KW  - EXPOSURE
