TI  - TREATMENT SERVICES FOR DRUG PROBLEMS. CHARACTERISTICS OF SUPPLY AND TERRITORIAL ACCESSIBILITY IN COSTA RICA
T2  - REVISTA GEOGRAFICA DE AMERICA CENTRAL
LA  - Spanish
