TI  - HIV risk and the association with accessibility coverage to medical facilities and socioeconomic status among heroin users in Kaohsiung, Taiwan (2011-2015): A GIS approach
T2  - KAOHSIUNG JOURNAL OF MEDICAL SCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - accessibility coverage
