TI  - Superhydrophilic hydrogel-enhanced conductive MOF-based wearable sweat sensors with anti-lipid biofouling capability
T2  - MICROCHEMICAL JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - Superhydrophilicity
KW  - Hydrogel
KW  - Conductive MOFs
KW  - Anti-lipid biofouling
