TI  - Road traffic noise and hypertension: results from a cross-sectional public health survey in southern Sweden
T2  - ENVIRONMENTAL HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - SELF-REPORTED HEALTH
KW  - LONG-TERM EXPOSURE
KW  - BLOOD-PRESSURE
KW  - AIR-POLLUTION
KW  - POPULATION
