TI  - An Innovative, Unobtrusive Approach to Investigate Smartphone Interaction in Nonaddicted Subjects Based on Wearable Sensors: A Pilot Study
T2  - MEDICINA-LITHUANIA
LA  - English
KW  - internet addiction
KW  - quality of life
KW  - smartphone addiction
KW  - social anxiety
KW  - HEART-RATE-VARIABILITY
