TI  - Sustainable Engineering of the Wearable Sensor for Noninvasive Health Monitoring Using Exfoliated Layered Double Hydroxide/Reduced Graphene Oxide/Poly(vinyl alcohol) Electrospun Fiber Composites
T2  - ACS APPLIED POLYMER MATERIALS
