TI  - Polyvinyl Alcohol-Stabilized Liquid Metal Hydrogel for Wearable Transient Epidermal Sensors
T2  - ACS APPLIED MATERIALS & INTERFACES
LA  - English
KW  - self-healing
KW  - hydrogel
KW  - liquid metal
KW  - transient electronics
KW  - epidermal sensors
