TI  - A robust, fatigue-resistant, self-healing, and recyclable κ-carrageenan-based ionic conductive hydrogel with synergistic K+/Ca2+ enhancement for multifunctional flexible sensor
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF BIOLOGICAL MACROMOLECULES
