TI  - Quantifying spatial accessibility in public health practice and research: an application to on-premise alcohol outlets, United States, 2013
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF HEALTH GEOGRAPHICS
LA  - English
KW  - Network analysis
KW  - Spatial accessibility
KW  - Alcohol outlet
KW  - NUMBER 7
