TI  - High-performance ionic thermoelectric hydrogels via electrohydrodynamic printing for self-powered wearable sensors
T2  - COLLOIDS AND SURFACES A-PHYSICOCHEMICAL AND ENGINEERING ASPECTS
LA  - English
