TI  - ARIEL: Advanced Radiofrequency Indoor Environment Localization: Smoke Conditions Positioning
T2  - 2011 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON DISTRIBUTED COMPUTING IN SENSOR SYSTEMS AND WORKSHOPS (DCOSS)
