TI  - Assessment of the Popularity and Perceived Effectiveness of Smartphone Tools That Track and Limit Smartphone Use: Survey Study and Machine Learning Analysis
T2  - JOURNAL OF MEDICAL INTERNET RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - smartphone addiction
KW  - internet addiction
KW  - internet gaming disorder
KW  - smartphone tools
KW  - telepsychiatry
