TI  - Multi-component collaborative design yields robust hydrogel sensors with superior environmental adaptability for machine learning-assisted gesture recognition
T2  - JOURNAL OF COLLOID AND INTERFACE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Hydrogel
