TI  - Simultaneous detection of salivary Δ9-tetrahydrocannabinol and alcohol using a Wearable Electrochemical Ring Sensor
T2  - TALANTA
LA  - English
KW  - Wearable THC sensor
KW  - Alcohol sensor
KW  - Marijuana sensor
