TI  - High strength and flexible aramid nanofiber conductive hydrogels for wearable strain sensors
T2  - JOURNAL OF MATERIALS CHEMISTRY C
LA  - English
KW  - DOUBLE-NETWORK HYDROGELS
KW  - FATIGUE-RESISTANT
KW  - TOUGH
KW  - COMPOSITES
KW  - ROBUST
KW  - FILMS
