TI  - Longitudinal Associations Between Neighborhood Physical and Social Environments and Incident Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus The Multi-Ethnic Study of Atherosclerosis (MESA)
T2  - JAMA INTERNAL MEDICINE
LA  - English
