TI  - Highly Flexible, Stretchable, and Self-Powered Strain-Temperature Dual Sensor Based on Free-Standing PEDOT:PSS/Carbon Nanocoils-Poly(vinyl) Alcohol Films
T2  - ACS SENSORS
LA  - English
