TI  - Mechanically robust and highly conductive bacterial cellulose hydrogels through synergy of directional freeze-thawing and salting-out for wearable sensors
T2  - CHEMICAL ENGINEERING JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - Bacterial cellulose hydrogels
KW  - Directional freeze-thawing
KW  - Salting-out effect
