TI  - An anti-freezing wearable strain sensor based on nanoarchitectonics with a highly stretchable, tough, anti-fatigue and fast self-healing composite hydrogel
T2  - COMPOSITES PART A-APPLIED SCIENCE AND MANUFACTURING
LA  - English
