TI  - Continuous Opioid Monitoring along with Nerve Agents on a Wearable Microneedle Sensor Array
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN CHEMICAL SOCIETY
LA  - English
KW  - FENTANYL
KW  - CASUALTIES
