TI  - Anti-freezing hydrogel regulated by ice-structuring proteins/cellulose nanofibers system as flexible sensor for winter sports
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF BIOLOGICAL MACROMOLECULES
LA  - English
KW  - Ice -structuring proteins
KW  - Anti -freezing hydrogel
KW  - Wearable strain sensor
KW  - ANTIFREEZE
