TI  - Evaluation of RIP Sensor Calibration Stability for Daily Estimation of Lung Volume
T2  - 2017 ELEVENTH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON SENSING TECHNOLOGY (ICST)
LA  - English
CP  - 11th International Conference on Sensing Technology (ICST)
