TI  - A Convolutional Neural Network for Smoking Activity Recognition
T2  - 2018 IEEE 20TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON E-HEALTH NETWORKING, APPLICATIONS AND SERVICES (HEALTHCOM)
