TI  - Optimizing Electrospun PVA Fibers with MXene Integration for Biomedical Applications
T2  - MACROMOLECULAR MATERIALS AND ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - biomedical use
KW  - electrical conductivity
KW  - electrospinning
