TI  - Tough, multifunctional, and green double-network binary solvent eutectogel with in-situ generation of lignin nanoparticles based on one-step dual phase separations for wearable flexible strain sensors
T2  - CHEMICAL ENGINEERING JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - Deep eutectic solvents
KW  - Eutectogels
KW  - Polyvinyl (alcohol)
