TI  - Tailorable Capacitive Tactile Sensor Based on Stretchable and Dissolvable Porous Silver Nanowire/Polyvinyl Alcohol Nanocomposite Hydrogel for Wearable Human Motion Detection
T2  - ADVANCED MATERIALS INTERFACES
LA  - English
KW  - hydrogel-based sensors
KW  - nanocomposite dielectrics
