TI  - A Qualitative Exploration of Attitudes Toward Global Positioning System Tracking and Ecological Momentary Assessment Among Individuals in Substance Use Treatment
T2  - SUBSTANCE USE & ADDICTION JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - qualitative
KW  - ecological momentary assessment
KW  - Global Positioning System tracking
