TI  - Deep Learning-Assisted Organogel Pressure Sensor for Alphabet Recognition and Bio-Mechanical Motion Monitoring
T2  - NANO-MICRO LETTERS
LA  - English
KW  - Wearable
KW  - Organogel
KW  - Deep learning
KW  - Pressure sensor
