TI  - Carbon-dots tailored polyoxometalate-based conductive hydrogels for flexible sensing materials with both high conductivity and exceptional mechanical toughness
T2  - JOURNAL OF COLLOID AND INTERFACE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Proton conductivity hydrogel
KW  - Polyoxometalates
KW  - Carbon dots
KW  - Excellent mechanical toughness
KW  - Strain and temperature sensing
