TI  - Examining how the geographic availability of alcohol within residential neighborhoods, activity spaces, and destination nodes is related to alcohol use by parents of young children
T2  - DRUG AND ALCOHOL DEPENDENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Alcohol outlet density
KW  - Activity spaces
KW  - Alcohol use
KW  - Parents
KW  - OUTLET DENSITY
KW  - UNITED-STATES
KW  - DRINKING
