TI  - A Hydrogel Electrolyte toward a Flexible Zinc-Ion Battery and Multifunctional Health Monitoring Electronics
T2  - ACS NANO
LA  - English
KW  - hydrogel electrolyte
KW  - aqueous zinc batteries
KW  - temperature adaptability
KW  - wearable electronics
