TI  - Smoking Activity Recognition Using a Single Wrist IMU and Deep Learning Light
T2  - 2018 2ND INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON DIGITAL SIGNAL PROCESSING (ICDSP 2018)
LA  - English
CP  - 2nd International Conference on Digital Signal Processing (ICDSP) / International Conference on Computer Graphics and Virtuality (ICCGV)
KW  - Activity Recognition
KW  - Smoking Gestures
KW  - Smart Band
KW  - IMU
