TI  - Humidity-Responsive and Self-Healable Conductive PEDOT:PSS-Based Hydrogel Fibers for Multifunctional Wearable Sensors
T2  - ACS APPLIED POLYMER MATERIALS
LA  - English
KW  - conductive fibers
KW  - PEDOT:PSS
KW  - wet-spinning
